#: crates/omado-cli/src/main.rs
msgid "Omado: your tasks, in Omarchy"
msgstr "Omado: twoje zadania w Omarchy"

#. Translators: quick entry understands your language: translate the example so that it keeps a date, a time, a #list, a @tag and a !priority it recognizes (a test checks it).
#: crates/omado-cli/src/main.rs crates/omado-core/src/parse/mod.rs
msgid ""
"Add a task, in quick entry syntax: “Call Paul tomorrow 9am #personal @phone !"
"1”"
msgstr ""
"Dodaje zadanie w składni szybkiego dodawania: „Zadzwonić do Pawła jutro o 9 "
"#prywatne @telefon !1”"

